the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base definition includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base definition includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/Definition.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


def public interest entity is identified by "http://example.org/Def_PublicInterestEntity".

def public interest entity is a definition.

def public interest entity has the definiendum "public-interest entities".

def public interest entity has the definiens "undertakings within the scope of Article 1 which are...".

def public interest entity is established in "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/point_1".


def related party is identified by "http://example.org/Def_RelatedParty".

def related party is a definition.

def related party has the definiendum "related party".

def related party is equivalent to def related party equivalent definition.


def related party equivalent definition is a definition.

def related party equivalent definition has for "rdfs:seeAlso" the resource "https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/ias-24-related-party-disclosures/".


def small undertakings is identified by "http://example.org/Def_SmallUndertakings".

def small undertakings is a definition.

def small undertakings has the definiendum "small undertakings".

def small undertakings has the definiens "undertakings which on their balance sheet dates do not exceed the limits of at least two of the three following criteria:...".

def small undertakings is established in "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/point_2".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query definitions is:
    which thing is a definition.

query definienda is:
    which definition has the definiendum which text.

query definientia is:
    which definition has the definiens which text.

query equivalent_definitions is:
    which definition has the same meaning as which second definition.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query other_resources is:
    which thing has for which property the resource which resource.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

